      "endTime": 2.352,
      "text": "I’m a student in Canada.",
      "words": ["I’m", "a", "student", "in", "Canada"],
      "translation": "我是一名在加拿大的学生。",
      "wordCount": 5
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "startTime": 2.8,
      "endTime": 4.72,
      "text": "I’m very busy this year.",
      "words": ["I’m", "very", "busy", "this", "year"],
      "translation": "今年我很忙。",
      "wordCount": 5
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "startTime": 5.296,
      "endTime": 12.992,
      "text": "I study maths, music, French, history, English, IT, science,",
      "words": ["I", "study", "maths", "music", "French", "history", "English", "IT", "science"],
      "translation": "我学习数学、音乐、法语、历史、英语、信息技术、科学，",
      "wordCount": 9
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "startTime": 13.12,
      "endTime": 16.848,
      "text": "and have gym. My favourite subject is music",
      "words": ["and", "have", "gym", "My", "favourite", "subject", "is", "music"],
      "translation": "还有体育。我最喜欢的科目是音乐。",
      "wordCount": 8
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "startTime": 16.928,
      "endTime": 21.04,
      "text": "because the class is fun and we learn a lot of new songs.",
      "words": ["because", "the", "class", "is", "fun", "and", "we", "learn", "a", "lot", "of", "new", "songs"],
      "translation": "因为这节课很有趣，而且我们学很多新歌。",
      "wordCount": 13
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "startTime": 21.424,
      "endTime": 23.856,
      "text": "Music always makes me happy.",
      "words": ["Music", "always", "makes", "me", "happy"],
      "translation": "音乐总是让我快乐。",
      "wordCount": 5
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "startTime": 24.352,
      "endTime": 27.024,
      "text": "My music teacher is excellent.",
      "words": ["My", "music", "teacher", "is", "excellent"],
      "translation": "我的音乐老师很优秀。",
      "wordCount": 5
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "startTime": 27.568,
      "endTime": 31.232,
      "text": "He lets us play all kinds of interesting instruments.",
      "words": ["He", "lets", "us", "play", "all", "kinds", "of", "interesting", "instruments"],
      "translation": "他让我们演奏各种有趣的乐器。",
      "wordCount": 9
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "startTime": 31.664,
      "endTime": 33.904,
      "text": "I want to be a singer in the future.",
      "words": ["I", "want", "to", "be", "a", "singer", "in", "the", "future"],
      "translation": "我将来想成为一名歌手。",
      "wordCount": 9
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "startTime": 34.48,
      "endTime": 37.424,
      "text": "How about you? What do you study?",
